    {"id": 3, "claim": "Solomon represents 1/25 (4%) of the named Islamic prophets.", "evidence": "Calculation: 1 (Solomon) / 25 (total named prophets) = 0.04 or 4%.", "weight": 0.15, "depends_on": [1, 2]},
    {"id": 4, "claim": "Solomon is not counted among the 'Kings of Judah' in the standard historical list.", "evidence": "The Kingdom of Judah was formed after the division of the united Kingdom of Israel. Solomon ruled the united kingdom. The list of Kings of Judah begins with his son Rehoboam (1 Kings 12:1-24). Therefore, Solomon is excluded from the specific list of Judahite monarchs.", "weight": 0.25, "depends_on": []},
